title: Analytics › Denial outcomes and dismissed recommendations
route: /analytics
intro: What other screens write back to Analytics. Two figures sit under the denial table and move when a denial is accepted or an appeal is ruled on. A card of dismissal reasons appears once a recommendation has been dismissed. Each event moves the numbers only a little.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the starting figures (96 rulings, 56% overturned, 17 accepted denials, $88.7K) are invented. Everything recorded in the demo counts in 'This quarter' and 'Last 12 months', never in 'Last quarter', and follows the payer menu.
---
start s1 "Scroll to the foot of 'Common denial reasons by payer'"
screen sc "Two figures under the table\n'Appeals overturned'  56%, '54 of 96 rulings this quarter'\n'Written off after accepted denials'  $88.7K, '17 denials this quarter'"

group gApp "Appeals overturned"
  ext x1 "The payer rules on an appeal\n(demo: the person logs the ruling)"
  store st1 "Denial Intelligence records the ruling\nOverturned, partly restored or upheld"
  process p1 "Rulings go up by one\nOverturned and partly restored also add to 'overturned'\nUpheld only adds to the rulings"
  decision q1 "Fewer than 20 rulings in this view?"
  screen o1 "For example 57%, '55 of 97 rulings this quarter'"
  screen o2 "'-' and 'Not enough decisions yet'\nA single payer with few rulings, for example Lakeshore"
endgroup

group gOff "Written off"
  click k1 "In Denial Intelligence the person accepts a denial"
  store st2 "Denial Intelligence records the write-off\nWith the payer and the dollars at stake"
  process p2 "Denials go up by one\nThe amount is added, for example $22.4K makes $88.7K into $111.1K"
  screen o3 "'$111.1K', '18 denials this quarter'"
endgroup

group gDis "Why recommendations were dismissed"
  click k2 "On a case, the person dismisses a recommendation and gives a reason"
  store st3 "Authorizations records the reason\nWith the request, so Analytics can find its payer"
  decision q2 "Any dismissal in this view?"
  screen d1 "Card 'Why recommendations were dismissed'\n'The reason given each time someone dismissed a recommendation, this quarter'\nOne row per reason, biggest first, '2 times' or '1 time'"
  screen d2 "No card at all\nNothing was dismissed, or the period is 'Last quarter', or the payer has none"
endgroup

process m1 "The monthly report and its printout carry the same figures\n'Denial outcomes' always, 'Why recommendations were dismissed' when the card shows"
process m2 "Pick another period or payer\nThe figures are worked out again from the recorded events"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › Record the payer's decision"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Accept the denial"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Dismiss and bring back"
goto g4 "Continues in: Analytics › Monthly report › What the files contain"
end e1 "Page matches what was recorded"

s1 --> sc
sc -.-> g1 & g2 & g3
x1 --> st1 --> p1 --> q1
q1 -->|No| o1 --> e1
q1 -->|Yes| o2 --> e1
k1 --> st2 --> p2 --> o3 --> e1
k2 --> st3 --> q2
q2 -->|Yes| d1 --> e1
q2 -->|No| d2 --> e1
sc --> x1 & k1 & k2
e1 -.-> m1 --> g4
e1 -.-> m2
